   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "I gave out the trade and market stock in the order it came in, like we always have. Quickest way.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1796630400.000000",
   "user_id": "U9PHI"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C9ALLOC",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Clementines are 14.20 a case now and the vine tomatoes 15.10, the new prices are out.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1796631600.000000",
   "user_id": "U9GIN"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C9ALLOC",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Round everyone to the nearest case, it's fairer than chopping bits off.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1796632800.000000",
   "user_id": "U9PHI"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C9ALLOC",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "St Brannoc's always have eight cases of vine tomatoes, I've keyed them as usual.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1796634000.000000",
   "user_id": "U9GID"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C9ALLOC",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Valli are still on stop, don't send them anything this week.",
